  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "거기 트레이너님,\n잠시 제 이야기를 들어 주시겠습니까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70AE300020D2B8B808C774B108B2D8002C000AC7A0C2DC0020C81C0020C774C57CAE30B97C0020B4E4C5B40020C8FCC2DCACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아이디어가 떠올라서 사업을 시작했는데,\n좀 곤란한 일이 생겨서 말입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C774B514C5B4AC000020B5A0C62CB77CC11C0020C0ACC5C5C7440020C2DCC791D588B294B370002C000AC8800020ACE4B780D55C0020C77CC7740020C0DDACA8C11C0020B9D0C785B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 사업이냐면, 꿈자리가 나빠서\n수면 부족을 겪고 있는 분들에게<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n최면술을 써서 주무실 수 있게 하는 겁니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020C0ACC5C5C774B0D0BA74002C0020AFC8C790B9ACAC000020B098BE60C11C000AC218BA740020BD80C871C7440020ACAAACE00020C788B2940020BD84B4E4C5D0AC8C00100001BE00000ACD5CBA74C220C7440020C368C11C0020C8FCBB34C2E40020C2180020C788AC8C0020D558B2940020AC81B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요즘 악몽에 시달리는 사람들이\n많다고 하잖습니까.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694C9980020C545BABDC5D00020C2DCB2ECB9ACB2940020C0ACB78CB4E4C774000AB9CEB2E4ACE00020D558C796C2B5B2C8AE4C002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 지금 문제가 생긴 상태입니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020C9C0AE080020BB38C81CAC000020C0DDAE340020C0C1D0DCC785B2C8B2E4002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손님께서 데려오신 꼬이밍고가\n잠에 들지를 않지 뭡니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C190B2D8AED8C11C0020B370B824C624C2E00020AF2CC774BC0DACE0AC00000AC7A0C5D00020B4E4C9C0B97C0020C54AC9C00020BB61B2C8AE4C002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "밍고?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC0DACE0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "배에 에너지가 너무 많이 쌓였는지\n전혀 잠들 기색이 없어요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC30C5D00020C5D0B108C9C0AC000020B108BB340020B9CEC7740020C313C600B294C9C0000AC804D6000020C7A0B4E40020AE30C0C9C7740020C5C6C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모오오옹...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8C624C624C639002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 손님이 첫 손님이라\n몽얌나도 많이 긴장한 모양이네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020C190B2D8C7740020CCAB0020C190B2D8C774B77C000ABABDC58CB098B3C40020B9CEC7740020AE34C7A5D55C0020BAA8C591C774B124C694002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드립니다.\n몽얌나에게 시범을 보여 주실 수 있을까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB9BDB2C8B2E4002E000ABABDC58CB098C5D0AC8C0020C2DCBC94C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC2E40020C2180020C788C744AE4CC694003F00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구체적으로 설명드리자면 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>최면술<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>과 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>꿈먹기<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>를\n꼬이밍고에게 사용해 주시면 됩니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CCCB4C801C73CB85C0020C124BA85B4DCB9ACC790BA74002000100002FF000006CD5CBA74C22000100002FF000000ACFC002000100002FF000006AFC8BA39AE3000100002FF000000B97C000AAF2CC774BC0DACE0C5D0AC8C0020C0ACC6A9D5740020C8FCC2DCBA740020B429B2C8B2E4002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>최면술<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>과 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>꿈먹기<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>를\n꼬이밍고에게 사용해 주시면 됩니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
