      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먼저 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>최면술<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>을\n부탁드리겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
