      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "불면증에 시달리던 꼬이밍고가\n잘 수 있게 도와주셔서 감사해요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD88BA74C99DC5D00020C2DCB2ECB9ACB3580020AF2CC774BC0DACE0AC00000AC7980020C2180020C788AC8C0020B3C4C640C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD574C694002100100002011401BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "밍고♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC0DACE0266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "푹 잔 덕분에\n기운을 완전히 되찾은 모양이에요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다음에 또 이용할게요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D4790020C7940020B355BD84C5D0000AAE30C6B4C7440020C644C804D7880020B418CC3EC7400020BAA8C591C774C5D0C694002E00100001BE00000AB2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020C774C6A9D560AC8CC694002100100002011401BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오! 정말이지 멋진 시범이었습니다!\n몽얌나도 다음부터는 할 수 있지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C62400210020C815B9D0C774C9C00020BA4BC9C40020C2DCBC94C774C5C8C2B5B2C8B2E40021000ABABDC58CB098B3C40020B2E4C74CBD80D130B2940020D5600020C2180020C788C9C0003F00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모오오옹♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
